Z||000022||Mach10||10-20-2001||03:24 PM||||Naw, rap sucks ass. But I'm not rabid about it. I just don't listen to it.<P>Tell me PLEASE, what of social value comes of of ANY of EMINEMs "music?"<P>Rap is about an attitude, and a proliferation of stereotypes. It does have similar underpinnings as Punk, but with far more emphasis on violence, drugs, and sexism, rather than the cultural rebellion inherent in the Punk sub-culture.<P>Don't give me this "it has a message" BS. i fail to see anything of relevance coming from "you know wha a dog needs?/a dog needs a ***** !" (DMX)? Don't make me start posting more lyrics. <P>I don't dislike rap for it's content. I've got a caustic vocabulary m'self. I dislike it for the attitude that it promotes: Where hard drugs are cool. Violence and weapons are acceptable, if not worthy of praise. And women are little more than objects for the entertainment of all the 'tough' men. <P>Punk has NEVER done that.<P>**** 'em all, give me goths. very nice, if disturbed, crowd  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000023||Matthew_Fiero||10-20-2001||03:59 PM||||Blink 182, is oficially classified as Pop<BR>Rap is the most poetic of music, now i don't really like Wutang too much but download Triumph by them. Lets see you come up with lyrics like that. I am white myself, i don't dress like a wigger, most of my friends don't like rap either, but i listen to it because i like it, i don't care what everyone thinks, not even my best friends. I like the beat, the base and the lyrics of rap, because too me, it makes me happy when i am sad, and gives me power when i work out. So what if you don't like rap, you don't have to go on endlessly about how much people shouldn't listen to it. Thats your opinion, and if your mature about it you'll keep it at that. Just because you dislike rap doesn't mean everyone will throw out their rap cd's JUST because you said it sucks.<P>Thats MY opinion<BR>||||reg||1
